Z||000000||rogergarrison||07-15-2000||08:13 AM||||<BR>I know the Fiero Festival is in Louisville, ky the end of the month. Anyone know where it is exactly? Ill be driving from columbus,ohio if anyone has directions. Anyone caravaning from my direction?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Phil||07-15-2000||09:22 AM||||I hope it's at the Ramada Inn in Jeffersonville IN (just across the way from Louisville) because that's where I made reservations. Go to <A HREF="http://www.ramada.com" TARGET=_blank>www.ramada.com</A>  and find the Jeffersonville hotel and they'll give you dir. and a map.||||reg||1
Z||000002||tgowens||07-15-2000||12:23 PM||||here, rogergarrison, is one of the original threads on this topic.  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/002532.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/002532.html</A>  As you will see, there are quite a few from that area going down. You might want to contact them by email (click on the profile icon to find their email address) or reply to this thread (It will be in the "General" section of the forum as it really isn't technical in nature) -- The Ramada is located on I-65 just across the bridge from Louisville in Jeffersonville, IN. My guess, from Columbus, take I-70 to Indianapolis and I-65 South ..........<P>------------------<BR>     '87 Fiero GT<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/3D_sig.gif">            <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
Z||000003||ChadMan||07-15-2000||06:47 PM||||Hey Roger, Central Ohio Fiero Enthusiasts (COFE) is going down to Louisville in a caravan from Columbus (I'm not sure if I will be able to join them or not).  They are leaving from the Ramada Inn North in Columbus (off Schrock Rd, near the junction of I-71/Rt. 161) at noon on Thursday.  I don't know if you're a member of COFE but I'm sure they won't care if you tag along even if you're not!||||reg||1
Z||000004||2M4 Dale||07-16-2000||09:33 PM||||COFE is leaving at 12:00 exactly. And they don't care if non-club members caravan with them...I am. Email me for more details if you would like. dalelee22@cs.com||||reg||1
